  "prefLabel": "Puc 902.19 Islanding",
  "priorExpiration": "2014-07-02",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 902.19 “Islanding” means a condition in which a portion of the utility system that contains both load and dispersed generation is isolated from the remainder of the utility system.\n\nSource. #10502, INTERIM, eff 1-3-14, EXPIRED: 7-2-14 (from Puc 902.15)\n\nNew. #10757, eff 1-8-15; ss by #13080, eff 9-14-20 (formerly Puc 902.14)",
